Core DAX Measures

Total Customers

Total Customers = COUNTROWS('public dim_customer')


Churned Customers (Leveraging binary flag logic where 1 = churned, 0 = active)

Churned Customers = SUM('public fact_customer_churn'[churn])


Overall Churn Rate (%)

Overall Churn Rate = DIVIDE([Churned Customers], [Total Customers], 0)


Total Spend / Revenue

Total Spend = SUM('public fact_customer_churn'[total_spend])